Close the previous WireGuard device before its replacement starts.

Upstream PR: https://github.com/MetaCubeX/mihomo/pull/3271
Upstream commit: 6b3b99b1d4926f2c0ddaa1570683b8956c1410ea

Downstream: wait for overlapping replacements to finish tearing down their
predecessors before bringing up the latest device.

